<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1834201413"/></metadata></head><body dur="4:44.040"><div begin="15.924" end="41.390" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="15.924" end="18.868" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="15.924" end="17.010">很想知道</span><span begin="17.010" end="17.713">你近</span><span begin="17.713" end="18.868">况</span></p><p begin="19.544" end="26.906" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="19.544" end="20.608">我听人</span><span begin="20.608" end="22.056">说</span> <span begin="22.977" end="24.452">还不如你</span><span begin="24.810" end="25.679">对我</span><span begin="25.679" end="26.906">讲</span></p><p begin="29.511" end="32.572" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="29.511" end="30.064">经过</span><span begin="30.064" end="30.706">那段</span><span begin="30.706" end="31.462">遗</span><span begin="31.462" end="32.572">憾</span></p><p begin="33.242" end="41.390" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="33.242" end="34.167">请你</span><span begin="34.167" end="35.834">放</span><span begin="35.834" end="36.970">心</span> <span begin="37.316" end="38.393">我变得</span><span begin="38.393" end="39.226">更加</span><span begin="39.226" end="39.713">坚</span><span begin="39.713" end="41.390">强</span></p></div><div begin="41.699" end="53.276" itunes:songPart="PreChorus"><p begin="41.699" end="46.609" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="41.699" end="42.681">世界</span><span begin="42.681" end="43.502">不管</span><span begin="43.502" end="44.292">怎样</span><span begin="44.292" end="45.014">荒</span><span begin="45.014" end="46.609">凉</span></p><p begin="48.460" end="53.276" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="48.460" end="49.752">爱过你</span><span begin="49.752" end="50.983">就不怕</span><span begin="50.983" end="51.732">孤</span><span begin="51.732" end="53.276">单</span></p></div><div begin="53.562" end="1:20.512" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="53.562" end="1:00.074" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="53.562" end="54.527">我最</span><span begin="54.5